<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">factored load per foot of backwall</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="632" left="18.00" top="11410.19" width="572.00" height="50.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="11418.69" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Plan note (SDM 12.3.F): &quot;The soil reinforcement attached to the backwall shall be designed by a Specialty Engineer for the service and factored loads as shown using the design criteria for permanent MSE walls. Cost of furnishing and installing the soil reinforcement is considered incidental to the cost of the end bent.&quot; Also add the SDG 1.15 note requiring the construction joints to be intentionally roughened to a 1/4 in amplitude.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="633" left="18.00" top="11466.19" width="572.00" height="50.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="11474.69" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Pending before final design: geotechnical confirmation of 2 in maximum settlement above the cap bottom (SDG 3.13.2.N.3); strap elevation at an MSE reinforcement level; final wall geometry (D-005); beam shrinkage strain; landing slab bearing and length; Strength III Kz for the cheek walls; environment for the covers. The pile-head force V_pile is not in the FBMP model; raise the strap toward e_res or confirm the piles carry it.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="634" left="18.00" top="11522.19" width="572.00" height="27.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="11530.69" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Notebook values for comparison: f_str,s = 3.621 klf; f_str,u = 4.328 klf; M_u,FF = 1.298 kip-ft; M_u,SF = 5.194 kip-ft; V_u,bw = 3.533 kip; T_u = 50.80 kip-ft; largest D/C = 1.000.</p></text>
</region>
</regions>
